I actually think this is one of the strongest parts of the concept because the simulation isn't "fake." It's backed by the player's own infrastructure. The simulation becomes a visual orchestration layer over real services, with the player deciding how much to connect.

I'd separate it into four layers.

Layer 1 - Simulation

